            0.121
          ],
          "content": "**Q.7. Choose a number between 210 and 390. Create a number pattern similar to those shown in Section 3.9 that will sum up to this number.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.121,
            0.359,
            0.139
          ],
          "content": "Ans. Number Chosen: 250"
        },
        {
